At 10 brokers paying you $50/month each = $500 MRR:

You're still on the same $46/month infra. Supabase Pro handles 10 tenants easily. Margin is ~90%.

Supabase doesn't charge per tenant — one project can serve all brokers with proper row-level security. You'd only add a second Supabase project if a broker demanded fully isolated data  
 (enterprise contract).

