When costs actually scale:

- Supabase bumps at ~$0.09/GB extra storage, $0.09/GB egress — only matters with lots of listing images
- Vercel bumps if you add serverless functions (you probably won't need them)
- Real cost pressure hits around 100+ active brokers, not before
